          "relation": "states",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 272,
            "text": "theorem exists_smooth_factor {c : ℝ} (hc : 0 < c) (j : ℕ) {b : ℝ → ℝ}\n    (hb : ContDiff ℝ ∞ b) :\n    ∃ F : ℝ → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ F ∧ F 0 = b 0 / (2 * c) ∧\n      ∀ x : ℝ, 0 ≤ x → primitive c j b x = scale c j x * F x"
          }
        }
      }
